==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM-P Promo|Gardevoir|408}}, one of the {{TCG|SM-P Promotional cards}} released only in Japan.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gardevoir}}.
*'''Psy Shadow''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-Power}} on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Gardevoir|7}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*'''Psyshot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Kadabra|58}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

